# Supabase project credentials. Copy to .env.local and fill in from
# Supabase dashboard > Project Settings > API.
#
# The anon key is meant to be public: it ships in the browser bundle and
# identifies the project, not a user. Row Level Security is what protects
# the data. Never put the service_role key here -- it bypasses RLS.
#
# With both values absent the app runs local-only and hides sign-in, so the
# repo works when cloned without a Supabase project.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
